    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Quiet Classroom</i></strong> is a dramatic visual novel with touches of humor. It tells the story of four troubled orphans enrolled in a rehabilitation program known as the &quot;Quiet Classroom.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Haruto Saito, a former Japanese soldier and World War III veteran. After being wounded in combat, Haruto returns home, only to face the threat of forced treatment in a veteran care facility due to his struggle to adjust to civilian life. But everything changes when a mysterious stranger offers him an alternative: to become a mentor in the Quiet Classroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Haruto help these four teenagers\u2014and himself\u2014confront the demons of their past? That\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2775a20e13237a02cfda003c649eefa9.avif?t=1751196006\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25fc <strong>Fully voiced in Russian</strong> (including the protagonist\u2019s inner thoughts) by the renowned dubbing studio <strong>RavenCat</strong>, known for its work on numerous popular titles \u2014 including the hit Russian visual novel <i>Tiny Bunny\u00a0</i>(<i>Zaychik</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25fc <strong>Over 100 original illustrations</strong> created by top-tier artists:<br>\u2014 <i>Animated backgrounds</i> by <strong>dankalaning</strong><br>\u2014 <i>High-quality character sprites with a wide range of emotions</i> by <strong>hehehell</strong><br>\u2014 <i>Animated CG scenes</i> by <strong>artsam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25fc <strong>A dynamic, branching narrative</strong> with more than five major story paths shaped by your choices \u2014 inspired by the tone and spirit of classic anime, with multiple secret endings to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25fc <strong>A rich, emotional soundtrack</strong> crafted by experienced composers \u2014 blending peaceful school-day tunes with the intense, chaotic sound of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Students:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9e5da03c479e592215826a59cf1c929b.poster.avif?t=1751196006\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9e5da03c479e592215826a59cf1c929b.webm?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9e5da03c479e592215826a59cf1c929b.mp4?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuto Nakajima</strong> \u2014 a typical delinquent and former gang member.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you find a way to get along with him?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/16b2e4738e06e457efaa89f6cb5987fb.poster.avif?t=1751196006\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/16b2e4738e06e457efaa89f6cb5987fb.webm?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/16b2e4738e06e457efaa89f6cb5987fb.mp4?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rin Miyamoto</strong> \u2014 a quiet, cautious girl with a painful past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you recognize the danger in time to earn her trust?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/6d8ed6367ea6d8b2d5ffac31176b9d2e.poster.avif?t=1751196006\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/6d8ed6367ea6d8b2d5ffac31176b9d2e.webm?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/6d8ed6367ea6d8b2d5ffac31176b9d2e.mp4?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kenta Suzuki</strong> \u2014 a friendly, easygoing guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He shouldn\u2019t cause any trouble... right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/766696ad346e806110d853f2867861ee.poster.avif?t=1751196006\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/766696ad346e806110d853f2867861ee.webm?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/766696ad346e806110d853f2867861ee.mp4?t=1751196006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emiko Yamashita</strong> \u2014 a shy, sweet girl with a rich inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you dare to help her bring it to light?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/78fce8a5679c088966ed1863f52056ab.avif?t=1751196006\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></h2>",
